1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Why do Koreans ask your age?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,900
몇 살이에요? (myeot sarieyo)
How old are you? Asked in minute one.

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,900
형 / 언니 (hyeong / eonni)
Older? They become your big brother.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:15,400
형이 쏜다! (hyeong-i ssonda!)
The answer: the older one pays.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,500
말 놓을까요? (mal noeulkka)
So — how old are you? 👇
